 takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQ7o0SOA_scQ7kNvwEPv3bT&_nc_oc=AdrgtXMlOF7joq3HKblynRTy85vlpnxGRklw4Gli1cdXsK0d9SQ9--Yvak9XihyZLcU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJqAx4LIllhRtXn4ggDZRoJ1Oyf4lInf_Kc2KDMb9UW7Q&oe=6AA961C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G7VLCJz5OQQQ7kNvwHIk9Jh&_nc_oc=AdqXvqPYKW7k5HSq1OYZXwNxFq8P4JSUw6m6X6Pj1HuZE9mz3LKmyXJLLaYU83ofGEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLMgXcOtaPEsOBwaDxxOfAY5MeiU3nqhOytusb3NSeYYA&oe=6AA936E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zB6kfuF-GRYQ7kNvwEYxMia&_nc_oc=AdqP5yqNOoNiyRAaAkEyaxs9QFV1m8FKYK0kDIxuMfFVGN1wnCYlw2osVEztJCiK6nY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJnQ1K4udMaqvzMFAgmaCOyAmlLjs356_IMN